        "created_at": "2014-02-01T11:58:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's a little ambiguous. But it appears she collapsed and Amina from main universe now has the memories of Amina from universe-saved -five-strangers. Given it's comics, this could be physical swap or mental transferracne or possession, but generally such things are somewhat reversible. So main-universe Amina could return/be rescued/<em>seem</em> to return and the heroes acept it because heroes, in general, are trusting spouls who can be fooled by a convincing liar who invokes the tropes of the setting, i.e. possession, mind-swaps, etc, etc.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
